OL,3,GNEWSABlues fan snubs Homes Under the
OL,4,AHammer over Villa's Dion Dublin
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Birmingham City fan has revealed why
OL,7,Fhe refused to appear on Homes Under the
OL,8,FHammer after discovering the presenter
OL,9,Fwas former Aston Villa striker Dion
OL,10,FDublin.
OL,12,FGeorge Pollock and his wife Catherine,
OL,13,Ffrom Castle Bromwich, were approached
OL,14,Fby the BBC daytime show's production
OL,15,Fteam after buying a property at auction
OL,16,Fto renovate and sell on.
OL,18,FWhile Catherine jumped at the chance to
OL,19,Ffeature on the programme, George was
OL,20,Frather less enthusiastic, and finding
OL,21,Fout who would be presenting the episode
OL,22,Fdid not help.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
