OL,3,GNEWSABlues fan snubs Homes Under the
OL,4,AHammer over Villa's Dion Dublin
OL,5,
OL,6,FGeorge said: "Catherine turned around
OL,7,Fand told me, 'It's going to be Dion
OL,8,FDublin.' I was like, 'Oh, you do it!'
